What's new BattleSteam "0.3.1.0".

The task with the groups was not solved until the end, so it was decided not to introduce it into the game yet since there are other tasks.
Updated menu;
Creating groups (Party) through steam;
Ability to leave the group;
Completely updated menu;
Redesigned location with trains;
Light version, low-value components that took up space are cut out;

Training mode with bots. The player needs to restrain enemy waves and build defenses.
The training mode will give the player the opportunity to get acquainted with the main controls in the game. In training mode, you can build from blocks and get acquainted with all types of weapons, in this collection the training mode will be available with limited functionality. The bot generator is not yet running in the process. Bots now bypass obstacles shoot at the player and break blocks.

The bug was fixed when after authorization the characters were not bought, but appeared only after the game was restarted. When someone leaves the game search queue, it is now correctly displayed in the game interface. The buttons now spell YES and NO for better understanding.
Edits in the UI of the main menu for confirming the action, now write YES and NO. At the location with the airships, lighting has been fixed; now the colors look softer and do not hurt the eyes. Removed 2 sights. Added ramps at the level with trains for people who fell through the platform. A platform for testing colliders has been added to the test level, you do not need to do streams from the test location! The cross icon which was responsible for the exit is now removed from the menu; now just press ESCAPE.

- New characters, all old characters have been redesigned;
- Completely redesigned menu;
- Display in the menu of users who are currently looking for a game;
- Now available for macOS users;
- Traps: a new look and shape;
- Sniper mode for 1 rifle;
- A few new blocks that will help to better hold the defense;
- Better integration with Steam;
